data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0a1d64ec5f22ea45006a9b6312ccc08194bb858efea703aa44","logprobs":[],"output_index":2,"sequence_number":152,"text":"Centralia, Pennsylvania, is well known for its underground mine fire, but it also has a typical humid continental climate. Here’s a summary of historical weather for Centralia, PA:\n\n### **General Climate**\n- **Average Annual High:** ~57°F\n- **Average Annual Low:** ~39°F\n- **Annual Precipitation:** ~52 inches\n- **Annual Snowfall:** ~25 inches\n- **Growing Season:** May to October (last frost ~May 10; first frost ~Oct 20)\n\n### **Monthly Climate Averages**\n| Month      | Avg High | Avg Low | Avg Precipitation |\n|------------|----------|---------|-------------------|\n| January    | 32°F     | 18°F    | 3.7 in            |\n| February   | 35°F     | 19°F    | 2.8 in            |\n| March      | 44°F     | 26°F    | 4.2 in            |\n| April      | 57°F     | 37°F    | 4.1 in            |\n| May        | 68°F     | 47°F    | 4.4 in            |\n| June       | 75°F     | 56°F    | 4.8 in            |\n| July       | 80°F     | 61°F    | 5.0 in            |\n| August     | 78°F     | 59°F    | 4.6 in            |\n| September  | 72°F     | 52°F    | 5.4 in            |\n| October    | 60°F     | 41°F    | 5.1 in            |\n| November   | 48°F     | 31°F    | 3.8 in            |\n| December   | 38°F     | 23°F    | 4.1 in            |\n\n### **Notable Annual Trends**\n- **Hottest Month:** July (Ave. high 81°F, low 61°F)\n- **Coldest Month:** January (Ave. high 32°F, low 18°F)\n- **Wettest Month:** September and July (~5 inches)\n- **Driest Month:** February (~2.8 inches)\n- **Snow:** Most snow falls in January; snow is common from October to May.\n\n### **Sample Year: September 2026**\n- **Min/Max**: 65°F / 85°F (moderate rain)\n- **Wind:** up to 10 mph, mostly mild\n- **Humidity:** ranges from 57–93%\n- **Pressure:** steady around 30 inches Hg\n\n### **Hourly & Yearly History**\nYou can check detailed hourly and yearly historic weather for Centralia from sites like [World Weather Online](https://www.worldweatheronline.com/v2/historical-weather.aspx?q=17927) and [Time and Date](https://www.timeanddate.com/weather/@5183788/historic).\n\n### **Links for More Data**\n- [Climate Averages Table](https://www.weatherworld.com/climate-averages/pa/centralia.html)\n- [Monthly, Yearly Weather](https://www.weather-us.com/en/pennsylvania-usa/centralia-climate)\n- [Plantmaps Climate Data](https://www.plantmaps.com/en/clim/f/us/pennsylvania/centralia/climate-data)\n\nIf you want specific weather for a date, let me know!"}

